  m_text: 'I have received your potion, I feel  closer to home thanks to you.

    Ah,
    it reminds me of the times we used to take strolls in the forest together, I
    do hope we do that again sometime in the future.

    A job well done calls for
    a little reward, here you go.

    Take care,'
